{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify theme section that closely matches the provided reference image of an Instagram coffee gallery. Reproduce the layout, spacing, typography, colors, image sizes, and alignment as accurately as possible.
    
    ### Section Layout
    - Create a full-width section with a warm off-white / cream background (#FFFCF6).
    - Use a centered content container with approximately 52px horizontal padding on desktop.
    - Keep the design clean, minimal, premium, and editorial, matching a modern specialty coffee brand.
    - Add generous whitespace and consistent spacing between all elements.
    
    ### Top Header Row
    - At the top-left, display a small Instagram outline icon followed by the uppercase label “FOLLOW OUR COFFEE MOMENTS”.
    - Use a small, bold, dark forest-green font, approximately 9–10px.
    - On the top-right, add the clickable text “Follow on Instagram” with a right-pointing arrow icon aligned horizontally.
    - Make the Instagram link configurable through the Shopify theme editor.
    - Ensure the entire Instagram CTA is clickable and opens the Instagram profile in a new tab.
    
    ### Heading and Description
    - Below the top header row, display the large heading:
      “A daily dose of neighborhood.”
    - Use a clean, modern sans-serif font with a regular font weight, approximately 36–38px on desktop.
    - Set the heading color to dark forest green (#193E32).
    - Keep the heading on one line on desktop.
    - Below the heading, add this description:
      “Coffee, connection and a little Florida sunshine. Find us on Instagram.”
    - Use muted gray-green text, approximately 14–15px, with regular font weight.
    - Maintain approximately 8–10px of vertical spacing between the heading and description.
    
    ### Instagram Image Gallery
    - Create a single horizontal row of 4 equally sized square image cards on desktop.
    - Use a 16px gap between each card.
    - Each card should have a 1:1 aspect ratio, approximately 208px tall at the reference image's displayed scale, with rounded corners of around 5px.
    - Use object-fit: cover to ensure images fill their containers without distortion.
    - Use four individually configurable image pickers in the Shopify theme editor.
    - The images should represent:
      1. A person enjoying iced coffee outdoors with a coffee bag.
      2. A close-up of roasted coffee beans.
      3. A branded coffee bag beside a ceramic mug in warm sunlight.
      4. A pour-over coffee setup with a coffee bag and ceramic cup.
    - Use the uploaded reference images when available. Do not replace existing supplied product packaging with unrelated products or change the branding on the coffee bags.
    
    ### Instagram Overlay Icons
    - Add a small white Instagram outline icon in the top-right corner of each image card.
    - Position the icon approximately 12px from the top and right edges.
    - Keep the icon subtle and consistent across all four cards.
    - Make each image card individually clickable with its own configurable Instagram post URL.
    - Open each post link in a new tab.
    - Add a subtle hover effect, such as a slight image zoom or gentle opacity transition, without changing the layout.
    
    ### Shopify Theme Editor Settings
    Provide editable settings for:
    - Section background color.
    - Heading text and color.
    - Description text and color.
    - Eyebrow label.
    - Instagram profile URL.
    - Four image pickers.
    - Four individual image link URLs.
    - Heading font size.
    - Image aspect ratio.
    - Image corner radius.
    - Gallery gap.
    - Desktop and mobile section padding.
    
    ### Responsive Behavior
    - Desktop: Display all four images in one row with equal widths.
    - Tablet: Display two images per row in a balanced 2-column grid.
    - Mobile: Display a horizontally scrollable gallery with compact spacing, showing approximately 1.5–2 image cards at once. Alternatively, use a 2-column grid if needed to maintain a clean layout.
    - Reduce the heading size to approximately 28px on tablet and 25–27px on mobile.
    - Stack the top header elements appropriately on smaller screens while keeping the Instagram CTA accessible.
    - Prevent horizontal overflow of the overall page.
    
    ### Development Requirements
    - Build this as a standalone, reusable Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    - Use clean Liquid, CSS, and schema settings.
    - Make every image, text element, link, and design setting editable through the Shopify theme editor.
    - Use inline SVG icons for the Instagram logo and arrow to maintain crisp rendering.
    - Preserve the existing theme typography wherever possible, while allowing the heading size and weight to be adjusted.
    - Avoid unnecessary borders, shadows, decorative elements, or extra buttons.
    - Do not add additional headings, product cards, or content not present in the reference.
    
    **Final goal:** Recreate the reference as closely as possible, particularly the cream background, dark green typography, compact Instagram header, oversized heading, muted subtitle, and four evenly spaced square coffee images.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-coffee-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__top-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 27px;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .09em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__follow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__follow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__follow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family, inherit);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 9px 0 27px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: {{ block.settings.gallery_gap }}px;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: {{ block.settings.image_ratio }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.corner_radius }}px;
    background: #eee9df;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} img,
  .ai-coffee-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform .35s ease, opacity .35s ease;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover img { transform: scale(1.035); }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; height: 100%; color: #d7d0c4; }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__empty-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    color: #4d5b50;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    color: #fff;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.35));
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .ai-coffee-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-coffee-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: {{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px 52px; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-coffee-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: 28px; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    .ai-coffee-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-right: 18px; padding-left: 18px; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__top-{{ ai_gen_id }} { align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: 9px; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__follow-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: 11px; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: 26px; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 14px; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin-right: -18px;
      padding: 0 18px 4px 0;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .ai-coffee-gallery__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} { flex: 0 0 68%; scroll-snap-align: start; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<section class="ai-coffee-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-coffee-gallery__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-coffee-gallery__top-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <p class="ai-coffee-gallery__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
        {{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}
      </p>
      {% if block.settings.instagram_url != blank %}
        <a class="ai-coffee-gallery__follow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Follow on Instagram
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <h2 class="ai-coffee-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    <p class="ai-coffee-gallery__description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>
    <div class="ai-coffee-gallery__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..4) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
          assign link_key = 'post_url_' | append: i
          assign gallery_image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign gallery_link = block.settings[link_key]
        %}
        {% if gallery_link != blank %}<a class="ai-coffee-gallery__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ gallery_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Instagram post {{ i }} in a new tab">{% else %}<div class="ai-coffee-gallery__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% endif %}
          {% if gallery_image != blank %}
            <img src="{{ gallery_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ gallery_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ gallery_image.width }}" height="{{ gallery_image.height }}">
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-coffee-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-coffee-gallery__empty-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Add gallery image {{ i }}</span></div>
          {% endif %}
          <svg class="ai-coffee-gallery__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
        {% if gallery_link != blank %}</a>{% else %}</div>{% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Instagram coffee gallery",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Content" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow label", "default": "FOLLOW OUR COFFEE MOMENTS" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "A daily dose of neighborhood." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "description", "label": "Description", "default": "Coffee, connection and a little Florida sunshine. Find us on Instagram." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "instagram_url", "label": "Instagram profile URL" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background", "default": "#FFFCF6" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "heading_color", "label": "Heading and accent", "default": "#193E32" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "description_color", "label": "Description", "default": "#59675F" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Layout" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop content width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "heading_size", "label": "Heading size", "min": 28, "max": 48, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 38 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "gallery_gap", "label": "Gallery gap", "min": 8, "max": 32, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 16 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "image_ratio", "label": "Image aspect ratio (width per height)", "min": 0.5, "max": 2.0, "step": 0.1, "default": 1.0 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "corner_radius", "label": "Image corner radius", "min": 0, "max": 16, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 5 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_desktop", "label": "Desktop section padding", "min": 32, "max": 120, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 64 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_mobile", "label": "Mobile section padding", "min": 20, "max": 80, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 40 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Gallery images and links" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_1", "label": "Image 1" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "post_url_1", "label": "Image 1 Instagram post URL" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_2", "label": "Image 2" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "post_url_2", "label": "Image 2 Instagram post URL" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_3", "label": "Image 3" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "post_url_3", "label": "Image 3 Instagram post URL" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_4", "label": "Image 4" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "post_url_4", "label": "Image 4 Instagram post URL" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Instagram coffee gallery" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "instagram-coffee-gallery"
}
{% endschema %}